      "text": "Requirements The gravedigger is holding a bull's-eye lantern in one hand and their religious symbol in the other, and the lantern contains oil\n\n---\nEffect The gravedigger recites a brief chant to ignite their lantern with vital energy. Each undead creature in a 15-foot line takes 3d6 vitality damage with a DC 14 basic Fortitude save save. This action uses all remaining oil in the bull's-eye lantern."
